  "text": "## Template 11: Account Closure Confirmation  \n**Subject:** Your FirstUK Bank Account Is Closed  \n```\nDear [Customer Name],\n\nYour FirstUK Bank account has been closed, effective [date].\n\nFinal Balance Details:\n- Account Number: [ACC-XXXXX]\n- Final Balance: £[amount]\n- Final Interest: £[amount]\n- Fees Applied: £[amount] (if any)\n- Net Payout: £[amount]\n\nHow You'll Receive Your Balance:\n[Selected method: transfer to new bank / cheque / cash at branch]\n- Timeframe: [3–5 business days]\n- Reference: [Transaction ID]\n\nImportant:\n- All standing orders and Direct Debits have been canceled\n- Your online banking access has been deactivated\n- Your card (if issued) is no longer valid\n\nWe'll Miss You!\nIf there's anything we could have done better, please let us know.\nYour feedback helps us improve.\n\nIf You'd Like to Reopen:\nContact us anytime at 0800-555-2265, and we'll be happy to help.\n\nThank you for banking with us!\n\nBest regards,\nFirstUK Bank Customer Service\n```  \n---",
  "name": "Chunk 13/15",
  "_domain": "banking.communications",
  "prev_chunk_id": "01a0742b-8524-77fa-82d5-14970cde8c21_012",
  "next_chunk_id": "01a0742b-8524-77fa-82d5-14970cde8c21_014",
